Ms. Zhao Jingling welcomed the first visit of her and her delegation to Cambodia and hoped that through today's discussions, the cooperation between the two countries' national associations would be strengthened and strengthened. Grow more.
She said the Beijing Red Cross Foundation was established in 2008 after an earthquake in Sichuan province.
