In order to avoid confusion and to have a broad understanding, Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommended humanitarian activities in this exercise: the Cambodian side can go to treat the Vietnamese people and the Vietnamese people come to treat the Cambodian people to prepare When there is a disaster, it can also push for programs like sports, arts together.
