The Board of Priests announces the death of Samdech Preah Thommalikhet Las Lay
(Phnom Penh): The Board of Priests of the Kingdom of Cambodia on the night of October 29, 2019, issued a statement and announced the death of Samdech Preah Thommalikhet Las Lay, Samdech Preah Sang, First Deputy President, President of the National Assembly Cambodia and Samdech Preah Chao Athikar Wat Sansom Kosal.
According to the announcement received by Fresh News, the Board of Priests of the Kingdom of Cambodia, all the students, the clergy and the laity are deeply saddened by the death of Samdech Preah Thommalikhet Las Lay. He passed away on Tuesday, October 2, 2019 at 3:00 pm at the age of 106 years old.
The body of Samdech Preah Thommalikhet was kept at Wat Sansom Kosal, Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 1, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh to celebrate the Khmer Buddhist tradition.
