(Da Nang): The direct flight from Phnom Penh to Da Nang by Cambodia Angkor Air has been officially inaugurated and launched for the first time with the expectation that Cambodia will receive more tourist growth from tourist destinations. This famous Vietnamese one.
The official inauguration took place at Danang International Airport on the afternoon of October 27, 2019, with a Cambodian delegation led by Mr. So Visothy, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Tourism, together with Ms. Chhay Sivlin, President of the Cambodian Association of Travel Agents and 57 Travel Agencies. Others, too.
Mr. Sovisothy said that the launch of this flight shows the strong commitment and efforts of Cambodia Angkor Air, Ministry of Tourism and the Secretariat of State for Civil Aviation, as well as relevant parties to connect Cambodia to destinations and Potential local market sources to attract international tourists from those markets and tourists from third countries.
At the same time, it also promotes trade, investment, economic cooperation and closer ties between Cambodia and Vietnam.
Ms. Chhay Sivlin said that the launch of direct flights from Phnom Penh to Da Nang will help boost the number of tourists coming to Cambodia, as tourists from Da Nang to Cambodia had to pass through in the past. According to Ho Chi Minh City, it takes a lot of time and money, maybe half a day or almost a day to get to Phnom Penh, but from now on, tourists only take 1 hour and 10 minutes.
The president of CATA said that the flow of tourists from Vietnam to Cambodia will increase and also hope to attract other foreign tourists passing through Danang to Cambodia. From other countries passing through this province are also many.
Ms. Chhay Sivlin also expressed her intention to have direct flights from Da Nang to other Cambodian destinations, hoping that Cambodia Angkor Air would expand direct flights to those destinations in the future.
As Da Nang has new and unique tourist destinations that should attract and attract third-country tourists, they may continue to visit Phnom Penh and Siem Reap through the new direct flights, such as Korean tourists. China, Japan and Europe.
The launch was also attended by private tour operators and airline agents to visit and expand their business, capturing new partnerships with Danang tour operators.
Cambodia Angkor Air is also offering special rates for direct flights from Phnom Penh to Danang for only $ 50 until the end of 2019, with five flights per week.
