President of the Association of Travel Agents: Increasing the number of direct flights between Cambodia and China will help increase the number of tourists
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Chhay Sivlin, President of the Cambodian Association of Travel Agents, said that the increase in additional flights of Chinese companies with direct flights between Cambodia and China will help boost the number of tourists.
Ms. Chhay Sivlin made this remark when she was invited to attend the inauguration of the new flight of Spring Airlines 2019-2020.
The new Spring Airlines flights will fly directly from Cambodia to Xi'an and from Cambodia to Nanjing.
"I am confident that this direct flight from Cambodia to Xi'an and from Cambodia to Nanjing will attract more tourists to Cambodia because of Spring Airlines' daily flights," said Chhay Sivlin.
She added that the main factor in adding flights is to bring more tourists to Cambodia, because in the past you have seen a decrease in the number of tourists flying to Siem Reap, and now we lack direct flights. Siem Reap province as well. That is why Spring Airlines increased its flights to Phnom Penh and beyond to Siem Reap.
Ms. Chhay Sivlin added that in order to attract more tourists to Cambodia, all of you must work together to provide quality and honest service with customers, and the relevant institutions must be involved in showing hospitality to customers and for vendors to sell. Honestly, there is ethics for tourism professionals, there must be ethics for guests as well.
Aminta, Marketing Director of Spring Airlines Thailand, said today that Spring Airlines officially launched the addition of direct flights from Cambodia to Xi'an and from Cambodia to Nanjing with daily flights.
She added that the reason Spring Airlines added the new flights was to attract tourists from Cambodia to Xi'an and Nanjing, as the two places had many famous historical sites, as well as to attract tourists from China. Cambodia.
