According to CamControl officials in Svay Rieng province, the inspection of goods today aims to ensure food safety because it is very important in society and daily life. He added that taking responsibility for food safety is a joint responsibility of professional institutions, importers, producers, distributors and consumers, because health is a key factor in the survival of life. .
