Samdech Techo Hun Sen further stated that after the operation of this autonomous unit is stable, the Royal Government will organize a competitive and transparent bidding process to find at least 4 companies to collect garbage and clean the city in both quality and quantity. Which the people can accept. The Royal Government expects that this new mechanism will help create more jobs for workers.
