* First name: Oeung Pheap, 43 years old, Occupation: Construction worker, living in a rented house in South Pork Village, Sangkat Kakap I, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh * Third: Name: Pok Sokny, 42 years old, Occupation: Driving a car (receiving stolen goods), Residence: Damnak Troyeung Village, Sangkat Choam Chao II, Khan Por Sen Chey.
Authorities report that the three were arrested at around 9 pm on October 21, 2019 in Por Sen Chey district after the three suspects conspired to rob and kill. Take a motorbike on the night of October 15, 2019 on a rice field road in Phum Khva, Sangkat Sak Sampov, Khan Dangkor.
Police said that after receiving reports from residents that there was an immediate death, the police force of the Sampov police station, in cooperation with the specialized force of the Dangkor district inspector, went to the scene and found a plastic gun near the body. The helmet will be on the motorcycle windshield and there will be scars on the neck and ribs on the body.
According to the relatives of the man, the victim was riding a 2015 Dream brand motorcycle and left home at 8 pm on October 15, 2019, but could not be reached until the morning of the 16th. Authorities said that the victim was beaten to death and robbed a motorcycle.
