PRASAC money transfer service facilitates customer growth
(Phnom Penh): Money transfer service is very important because people can transfer money and receive money easily, safely and reduce daily busyness, as well as facilitate business activities and living.
PRASAC is the largest financial institution in Cambodia and has the largest number of branches in Cambodia. Currently, PRASAC customers can transfer money to business partners, close friends, relatives from account to account or transfer money to those who do not have an account or can transfer money through the bank.
With PRASAC Money Transfer, customers can transfer money by ATM or Mobile Banking or PRASAC Mobile Banking or can come to the nearest PRASAC office. Warm and friendly service from PRASAC staff throughout the capital and provinces in Cambodia.
Please be informed that PRASAC provides many kinds of financial services, including: Credit, Deposit, Savings, Water Bill Payment, Electricity Bill Payment, Money Transfer, Money Transfer, Phone Card Payment, Payroll, Quick Payment, Bank Payment, ATM, POS, Banking Mobile and account balancing services covered nationwide.
