OPINION: For a clean city, a garbage-free city must join together
(Phnom Penh): The people of Phnom Penh expressed their congratulations and happiness after hearing that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, announced the introduction of new measures on garbage collection in Phnom Penh by adding at least one garbage collection company. 3 or 4.
After hearing the announcement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, people in Phnom Penh expressed high hopes that garbage collection in Phnom Penh will be better than now.
The appearance of the head of the Royal Government on the organization of a garbage collection company in Phnom Penh shows the strong will and the highest concern of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in organizing the beauty and beauty of Phnom Penh, as well as improving the well-being of Citizens, too.
However, it is seen that in order to make Phnom Penh a beautiful city without litter, it is not possible to rely on garbage collection companies without the participation of all citizens.
Measures In addition to setting up more garbage collection companies, the authorities should deploy more bins in public places to allow people to store garbage.
Should increase the education of people to understand the proper storage of garbage, not easy to eat food and throw garbage in the open. In addition, people need to be educated on how to properly dispose of garbage, including the distribution of garbage in some countries, such as Japan.
Proper packaging of trash is also a great help to garbage collectors. Currently, it is seen that the storage of garbage is not good yet, causing garbage or water in the garbage to scatter in the place. Some rubbish is not tied properly when thrown away, causing the garbage bag to slip out of the mouth, and the rubbish is scattered in the garbage dump. .
Therefore, the proper arrangement and distribution of garbage by the people is a matter for the people to be highly aware of.
Garbage pricing is also something to consider. Currently, the price of garbage per house is usually around $ 1 per month, but a big house or business place can be more expensive. The price of garbage collection per household, which is as low as $ 1 per month, is still seen as a small amount, which is a problem that makes the garbage collection services less efficient.
In order to get better garbage collection service, do people dare to increase the price for garbage collection service? While drinking a cup of coffee or a meal at a time is more expensive than spending a month on trash.
Some people, not to mention picking up trash, dumping it in the yard, even picking up their trash and leaving it for them to pick up, so we dare to offer a higher price for garbage to encourage collectors. Garbage?
In general, for our Phnom Penh to have no garbage, in addition to the actions of the head of the Royal Government, the garbage collection company, we, all citizens, must participate together, eat, do not leave the open field, must be placed in the trash, properly packed and distributed garbage. And should increase the cost for garbage collection services to collect better and faster than now.
