During the ceremony, the people as well as all the village and sangkat authorities in Kambol district expressed their satisfaction that the authorities listened to the voices of the people and accepted the requests raised by the people to help respond to and Concerns that people are facing at the grassroots level in helping to respond.
Mr. Khim Sunsoda said that after consulting with the people throughout the morning, there are many issues that are the concerns of the people who asked the authorities, and the authorities have accepted those requests to check. Ability to deal appropriately with them as well.
In this ceremony, according to the people in the third consultation forum of the district, there are many problems that people ask to help solve, including local road construction, drainage, garbage. Water problems, electricity problems, land grabbing problems, road problems, security issues, public order, especially public service issues.
Dr. Ing Kantha Phavi expressed her satisfaction with the results of today's forum, finding out the real concerns of the people and we responded appropriately.
She said that all requests must be addressed by the authorities, especially the service needs are the need to address the people in a timely manner. For requesting services, the authorities must examine the actual feasibility of what can be resolved, release it to the people immediately, and what is beyond the capacity to report to the request for principles to help solve.
In general, what are the concerns and needs of the people must not be ignored, no matter how much can be solved, must try to help solve them as much as we can, do not let people lose faith. We are their servants.
She also reminded the authorities to strengthen the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes, so that each locality maintains security and good order, no big brother, little brother, gangsters, drugs, gambling and theft, etc. Ensure peace for the people.
