Both meetings with the Prime Minister and the Emperor of Japan, the King of Cambodia, as well as the Japanese side reiterated the excellent relations between Cambodia and Japan, which lasted for about 66 years. The Japanese side also affirmed the strengthening of relations and cooperation with Cambodia, as well as supporting and continuing to support the development of Cambodia.
