He told the people that our country has laws and the law punishes those who do not respect or do not follow, not only the party or any individual must face punishment according to the law. Therefore, as a citizen, we must respect the law in force and follow the clear path of the Royal Government, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister.
