Khsach Kandal CPP Youth Movement Tells Youth Not to Be Deceived by the Poisonous Campaign of Sam Rainsy
(Kandal): Mr. Kao Thach, President of the Youth Movement of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), Khsach Kandal District, Kandal Province, on the morning of October 23, 2019, held a meeting to disseminate the latest political situation to a total of 290 youth members at the party's headquarters. Cambodian people, Khsach Kandal district, Kandal province.
Mr. Kao Thach continued that, in fact, Sam Rainsy made a press release on September 15, 2019:
1: Openly call on the National Armed Forces to secede from the government by using bribery by offering money in exchange for secession, which is considered to be the beginning of an attempt to organize the Armed Forces to overthrow the coup. Legal government.
2. Announced a mechanism to implement the plan using the structure of the former CNRP, both inside and outside the country, which is an illegal political organization and a target of the organization that carried out the coup plan.
Mr. Kao Thach asked the people:
Participate in maintaining peace and political stability with the Cambodian People's Party.
* Must respect the law and spread the word to the family, relatives and friends to understand the activities and tactics of the poison and danger of Sam Rainsy and must strictly avoid participating in activities related to the return plan of the group. Convict Sam Rainsy, who had embedded a poisonous torch and intended to overthrow the legitimate Royal Government, dissolve the monarchy and change the country's political regime.
* Join the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), against the dangerous plans and tactics of Sam Rainsy's convicts, and join in defending the Constitution, defending the monarchy, defending liberal democracy, pluralism, and maintaining peace and social stability. To continue the socio-economic development and to improve the living standards of the people in harmony.
* Continue to strengthen solidarity, continue to support each other among the people, local authorities without discrimination and without political affiliation.
In addition, Mr. Kao Thach continued to call on all people to participate in the celebration of the nation, religion, the King on November 9 in the villages, communes, districts, provinces across the country to show the strength of the people. Khmer nation and to jointly preserve the culture, traditions, customs and dignity, as well as to celebrate the National Independence Day and the birthday of our Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
Minister of Information Requests Spokespersons of All Ministries and Institutions to Jointly Prevent and Eliminate False Information (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Accurate information to prevent and eliminate false information that is rampant, leading to a negative impact on society.
The Minister's proposal was made on the occasion of closing the seminar on the field of information under the theme "Good governance in the context of information flow in the digital age" at the Office of the Council of Ministers on the evening of October 22, 2019.
After asking for joint efforts to prevent, neutralize and eliminate false information, the Minister of Information also urged all spokespersons to speak the truth and avoid using false words that discredit the public.
The spokesperson of the Royal Government of Cambodia has invited relevant officials in various ministries, institutions, deputy governors of the capital and provinces, and officials in charge of information of the capital and provinces throughout the country to prevent and neutralize false information for two days from the 21st. Until October 22, 2019.
"Because of him, due to the lack of cooperation within the ministry in his office, the closeness with the leadership can provide some information for the spokesperson, but the spokesperson has to change because the Ministry of Information is Establish a law called the right to information. "Spokesmen or spokespersons are punished according to the law."
The Head of the Spokesperson Unit of the Royal Government of Cambodia also reminded that those who are information officers or spokespersons for any ministry, institution or unit must be active, professional and highly effective.
Mr. Chhay Sophal, Professor of Journalism, believes that the inactive spokesperson is caused by the inactivity of the Ministry or the institution as a whole. The whole institution is inactive because it does not properly delegate the information power of that institution for a good spokesperson.
"Our executives must understand the work of the spokesperson to participate everywhere, except for some secret work," he said. "When a journalist asks a spokesperson and the spokesperson does not know, it is not only the spokesperson who is bad, but also the institution because the institution did not delegate the power to provide information to him."
Senior Minister Meas Sophea urges people not to be deceived by Sam Rainsy's poisonous propaganda and to remain silent to escape legal confrontation
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Meas Sophea, Senior Minister in charge of Special Mission and Chairman of the National Task Force in Preah Vihear Province, urged the people not to be deceived by the poisonous propaganda of Sam Rainsy and his cronies instead by keeping quiet. To escape legal confrontation and to participate in maintaining peace and security of the nation.
He advised to educate the family, relatives and friends to clearly understand the poisonous activities and tactics of Sam Rainsy and his accomplices, and to strictly avoid participating in activities related to the return plan of Sam Rainsy. Rainsy.
At the same time, the Senior Minister said that those involved in the crime of conspiracy with Sam Rainsy could be convicted if they took any action, such as announcing support for Sam Rainsy's return plan. Announce to receive the return of the prisoner and gather to receive the return of this prisoner.
Senior Minister Meas Sophea said that "the use of the structure of the former CNRP at all levels, which the party was dissolved by the Supreme Court to participate in the implementation of the above plan is against the Supreme Court ruling. "The law on political parties is both criminal and illegal."
