Speaking at the certification ceremony, Mr. HUN Many stated that as a young person to take turns, not only to expand the work, but to reduce and sharpen the work more clearly and solve problems to the point, so the implementation of the principles. Politics must be flexible to the circumstances and realities of each geographical area.
Please be informed that the new Kindergarten course is one of the other courses of the Political Leadership Development Program organized by the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Phnom Penh under the leadership of Mr. Say Sam Al.
The new nursery course is to train young people who are active in social work and civil servants at all levels to have an understanding of the political landscape and have the ability to analyze socio-political events for the benefit of their daily professional work as well as for work. Explain and explain in any circumstances to the public and the people.
This training course focuses on 10 priority topics, including: 1: Political geography, 2: Moral philosophy, 3: World civilization, 4: Legal theory, 5: Psychology, 6: Methodology Socio-cultural research, 7th: world history, 8th: general psychology, 9th: economic theory and 10th: political theory.
