Vital's Modern Charity Program "You Are a Hero" is back again
(Phnom Penh): After the great success of the project "You are a hero" last April, raised $ 8,650 to donate to Angkor Hospital for Children in Siem Reap. Vital has decided to continue the charity project "You are a hero" for the second time, with many requests from customers as well as fans on social media, which officially opened this morning, Tuesday, October 22, 2019 at Eden Garden Shopping Mall.
"You Are a Hero" is a charity project that gives the general public the opportunity to contribute individually to the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia by simply purchasing vital water through 18 vending machines throughout the capital.
The second project is for a full year, and we expect to receive more funding to meet the demand for Kantha Bopha Hospital.
The creation of this project is based on three main objectives, including:
* To strengthen the culture of individual sharing * Connecting charity programs with modern machines * Raise funds through the sale of water Contribute to the treatment of poor Cambodian children with Kantha Bopha Hospital.
Ms. Chheng Sokuntheavy, General Manager of NVC Corporation "Vital" said that based on the 25R fund, Vital has set up this modern charity program for the second time and she strongly hopes to have more supporters from all over the world. More than ever.
In addition, she thanked Vital clients for their contribution to all humanitarian work and requested that Vital support this project so that Vital can raise funds to support the Kantha Bopha Foundation in the care and treatment of Cambodian children. For the better.
It should also be noted that this is a new project of Vital to raise funds to support Kantha Bopha Hospital, following many projects that have been done in the past, such as the annual cycling in Siem Reap, the registration of all Vital staff of 808 Annual membership along with many other activities.
Based on the 25 R budget, Vital is committed to continuing to participate in all good activities in society as a testament to the participation of Vital customers. Customers just buy Vital drinking water means that you are participating in the merit and contribute to help and develop society a lot. "Vital is proud of the national product."
