Minister Pich Bunthen: The health sector is the backbone of the nation to support the well-being of the people
(Kampong Cham): The Honorable Dr. Pich Bunthen, Minister of Public Works and Chairman of the National Commission for the Assessment of Public Service Units, stated that the health sector is the backbone of the nation to support the well-being of the people.
Mr. Kittibandith said so in the workshop to share the experience of management and public service delivery of the model public service unit in the health sector for two days, October 21-22, 2019 at Kampong Cham Provincial Hall.
Dr. Pich Bunthen reminded the whole ceremony about the Royal Government's ambitious vision to transform Cambodia into a high middle income country by 2030 and a high income country by 2050. And reduce all forms of poverty in Cambodia.
"Therefore, the health sector, which is the backbone to support the well-being of the entire population, must be constantly improved so that we have a healthy and energetic population to work for our economic and social development."
