(Phnom Penh): Infant nutrition plays an important role in saving the life of the baby, because the right nutrition will help the baby to be strong and reduce the mortality rate. In fact, the Cambodian Pediatric Association organized the third conference under the theme "Baby Nutrition" on October 19, 2019.
