She recalled the background of the establishment of the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia, as well as the contribution of the Kantha Bopha Swiss Foundation and the invaluable merits of Professor Dr. Beat Richner, who contributed and sacrificed physical and mental strength for the future and smiles of Cambodian children. .
She also mentioned the main purpose of the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia, which is not only to help find sources of funds to support the sustainability of Kantha Bopha Hospital, but also to cultivate and promote the spirit of helping each other under the slogan Khmer help Khmer More widely throughout the country through charitable donations and membership of the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia.
