He also pledged to continue to contribute to the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia and promote the values of the Cambodian spirit to help Cambodians more widely.
His Majesty the King and Mrs. once again thanked and encouraged the leaders, civil servants and people of Kampong Chhnang to continue to participate and promote the participation of the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia and be a role model to contribute to society, especially By promoting the welfare of Cambodian children.
