The Kathina ceremony took place on the afternoon of October 18, 2019. At 3 pm, gather Buddhists near and far to worship the Preah Ratanatray, recite the Samathan Sil, invite the monks to prosper, and give a sermon at Wat Lanka Preah Kosomaram.
