(Phnom Penh): Khmer fresh milk from the efforts of research and overcome many obstacles of the Royal Academy of Cambodia has been distributed in the market. Currently, this fresh milk is being distributed in some supermarkets in Phnom Penh, and there is also delivery of orders and distribution to the provinces.
The official of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, who distributes this fresh milk, emphasized that Techo Sen Russey Trup Fresh Milk is 100% pure milk without any added chemicals or preservatives that can affect the health of consumers. No. This milk is full of protein and high in calcium, it promotes health, promotes growth, nourishes the bones, and makes you smarter.
This group of young people who drank fresh Khmer hand-made milk expressed their pride that Cambodians can produce fresh milk for their own drinking. These youth groups also called for support for this Cambodian product.
(Phnom Penh): In order to facilitate the travel of people who do not face traffic congestion, the Phnom Penh Municipal Authority has started to study two new subway construction projects in Phnom Penh.
