Phnom Penh International Airport CamControl Officers and Laboratory Officers Bring Mobile Laboratory Vehicles to Inspect and Disseminate Food Safety Quality in Po Sen Chey District
(Phnom Penh): On October 18, 2019, Camcontrol Branch Officer of Phnom Penh International Airport, in cooperation with the officials of the Department of Commerce and the Market Commission, brought a mobile laboratory vehicle of the General Department of Camcontrol to inspect and disseminate the food safety quality at the market. Century Plaza and some Star Mart in Phnom Penh's Por Senchey district.
