In this 5th mandate meeting, the Cambodian Red Cross, chaired by Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, appointed Mr. HUN Neng as the Honorary Chairman and Honorary Vice President of the branch, a total of 19 people.
Full members elected the 5th Mandate Branch Committee, consisting of 15 members, 3 females, including Mr. Un Chanda as the Chairman of the Branch Committee, Ms. Pang Dany, Permanent Vice Chairman, Mr. Huot Vuthy, Vice Chairman, Mr. Pen Mardy, Vice Chairman, Ms. Chan Vanny, Treasurer and Ms. Sopheak, Branch Committee Secretary.
