(Phnom Penh): The Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Phnom Penh, in collaboration with the Institute of Technology of Cambodia, Royal University of Phnom Penh, Prek Leap National School of Agriculture and the private sector research and institutes, organized the "21st Century Agro-Industrial Forum" under the theme: Smart Farmers and the Future of Cambodia. "
