(Bulgaria): Cambodia and Bulgaria have decided to sign three more important documents to further strengthen relations and cooperation with each other.
First: Agreement on Economic, Scientific and Technical Cooperation between the Royal Government of Cambodia and the Government of Bulgaria
Second: Program for Cultural Cooperation between the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts of Cambodia and the Ministry of Culture of Bulgaria
Third: Memorandum of Understanding between the National Institute of Diplomacy and International Relations of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, Kingdom of Cambodia and the Diplomatic Institute of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Bulgaria.
