(Phnom Penh): Mr. Has Vary, Personal Adviser and Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, brought money to attend the funeral of Chum Sorn, a former official of the Ministry of Industry, who passed away on the 13th. October 2019 at the age of 75 due to old age.
On the occasion of attending the cremation ceremony of Mr. Chum Sorn at Wat Non Mony, Sangkat Steung Meanchey, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh, Mr. Has Vary brought 10 million Riels from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Katiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to the family and Express emotions, share condolences, be extremely sad.
In addition, Mr. Has Vary donated 250,000 Riels to each of the five monks, 50,000 Riels to each of the four abbots, and distributed to 200 monks who participated in his cremation ceremony. Each person received 20,000 riel and a sermon book.
