(Thailand): The second Five Territory Pilgrimage started this morning, October 15, 2019, departing from Chiang Sen District, Chiang Rai Province, Thailand and continuing to four other countries in the Mekong region: Thailand, Myanmar, Vietnam, Laos and Cambodia as well.
