Announcing the appointment of the new Director of Kampot Provincial Department of Public Function, Mr. Nop Bunnang, replacing Mr. Chin Vantha
(Kampot): On the afternoon of October 14, 2019, Mr. Nop Bunnang was announced as the new Director of the Department of Public Function of Kampot Province, replacing Mr. Chin Vanna as the new Director of the Department.
The ceremony was attended by Mr. Kittibandit Pich Bunthen, Minister of Public Works and Mr. Chiao Tay, Governor of Kampot Province, as well as the leaders of the departments around the province, the leaders of the three types of forces, the governors of the districts, provincial courts and provincial prosecutors. About 350 civil servants.
The provincial governor, Mr. Chiao Tai, instructed the newly-appointed officials and all four government officials, including:
* First, continue to pay attention to the effective implementation and high sense of responsibility in accordance with their respective roles and responsibilities, as well as strengthen the implementation of laws, regulations and guidelines of the Royal Government, the Ministry of Public Works and Provincial Administration.
* Second: Strengthen solidarity and internal unity with the leaders and civil servants at all levels in the department, namely the proposal to eliminate inactivity and increase the spirit of respect for professional ethics:
* Fourth: Pay attention, encourage, educate, guide, create and provide job opportunities for young officers who are human resources for the next shift in the future.
The Honorary Minister of Public Works also urged the new director of the department to help protect the interests of civil servants in the province, as well as to the provincial governor on public functions, especially to better understand the statistics of civil servants in the province.
