It should be noted that on October 5, 2019 in Hanoi, Vietnam, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Nguyen Suon Phuc signed the Supplementary Treaty of the 1985 State Boundary Treaty and the 2005 Supplementary Treaty between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Socialist Republic. Vietnamese.
The 1985 and 2005 treaties were an agreement between Cambodia and Vietnam in accordance with the laws of both countries as well as international law to facilitate the demarcation and demarcation of borders between the two countries.
