(Preah Vihear): Many types of illegal fishing gear were dismantled and destroyed by the Fisheries Administration of the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Preah Vihear Province as the team inspected Stung Sen River in Reaksa and Putra communes. Rovieng District, Preah Vihear Province.
On the morning of October 11, 2019, Mr. Peng Trida, Director of the Department of Agriculture, said that in order to keep all kinds of fish species alive, the Fisheries Officer of the Provincial Department of Agriculture always inspected the rivers and lakes. The main nature of the purpose is to protect the fish species from any illegal fishing by the people, such as the use of fishing gear with electric nets and nets.
