Kandal Provincial Administration Expects Water Festival in Takhmao City to Shake This Year Than Last Year
(Kandal): Mr. Kong Sophorn, Deputy Governor of Kandal Province, expects that during the two days of the boat race in Takhmao City, Kandal Province, people will come to visit, enjoy and shake more than last year.
Speaking to Fresh News on October 10, Mr. Kong Sophorn continued that the boat race will be held from October 12 to 13 at the mouth of the Bassac River, Takhmao, Kandal province. The Kandal Provincial Administration organizes this boat race every year with the support of a large number of people from year to year.
