(Tbong Khmum): Senior Minister Kun Kim, First Vice Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management, and his wife, Ms. Koeng Chandy, this morning, October 9, 2019, continued to bring nearly 42 tons of rice seeds to distribute to more than 500 affected families. Damage to crops due to floods during this year's rainy season.
