The people who suffered and damaged the rice crop after receiving the rice seeds and thanked the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit, as well as the National Committee for Disaster Management. They are also determined to replant in time for the rains at the end of the rainy season to get some produce back to sustain life.
