3. Assign the task to the local authority of Preah Sihanouk province (village, commune, district and province) to continue to discuss and find a solution with the people who have been living near the fence of Sihanoukville International Airport based on the existing principles and report to the group. Check and solve work.
4: Assign the task of land impact management team in Sihanoukville International Airport Development Project to continue to discuss and find solutions for 7 affected families in Sihanoukville International Airport Development Project based on the principles of the Royal Government.
5: Assigned Mr. Soy Sokhan, Undersecretary of State of the Secretariat of Civil Aviation and Permanent Deputy Chairman of the Working Group on Land Impact Assessment in the Sihanoukville International Airport Development Project, to continue to monitor the implementation of the airport development project and the construction of the Sihanoukville International Airport fence. Sihanouk.
