The operation was carried out under the direct command of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner General, Deputy Commissioner General for Judicial Police Planning, and pointed out by Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department, assigned to Lt. Col. Cheav Vibol Anou. The director of the Criminal Police Department opened the investigation.
