(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism and the "Inter-Ministerial Commission to Study the Master Plan for Tourism Development in Siem Reap" on October 4-5, 2019, organized the second consultation workshop on "Planning Project". Master for Tourism Development in Siem Reap ”at Angkor Sokha Hotel, Siem Reap.
