Mr. Kim Rithy: Donating blood is the most precious humanitarian activity, a festival and a life-saving
(Kandal): Mr. Kim Rithy, Deputy Governor and President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Kandal Province, said that for the people, the armed forces, students, youth of the Cambodian Red Cross, the Cambodian Red Cross and more than 300 scouts who contributed. Blood is an activity and a good example for other people who come to donate blood, because the most precious humanitarian activity is a festival that can save lives.
He said this during the voluntary blood donation campaign on October 4, 2019 at Jayavarman VII High School, Kien Svay district, Kandal province, with patients in hospitals need about 300 bags of blood per day. This is why blood donation is the most important factor that can not be overlooked.
Dr. Sok Po, President of the National Blood Transfusion Center, said, “Currently, the National Blood Transfusion Center is having a hard time collecting blood due to the small number of blood donation volunteers, according to the National Blood Transfusion Center It shows that there are only 25% blood donors in Cambodia. ”
"Blood is very important because blood cannot be produced, it can only be taken from people, so without blood donors, we have no blood to save patients," he said.
He added that blood donation is not a health problem, on the contrary, those who donate blood will get many health benefits, can help reduce stroke, reduce blood clots, reduce the rise. Weight and fat reduce heart disease. In addition, donating blood allows you to know your health status because before and after donating blood, you must go through a medical examination to be able to donate.
Please note that in the voluntary blood donation campaign, which received a total of 75 bags of blood, including 21 bags of women, and for blood donation, the general public can donate, which requires 18 years of age or older. From 45 kg up, normal blood pressure, enough red blood cells and healthy. The driver of the Independence Monument roundabout continued, last night, the police stopped 2 more vehicles
