The commitment of the top leaders of Cambodia and Vietnam was made during a bilateral meeting between Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and his Vietnamese counterpart Nguyen Suon Phuc in Hanoi, Vietnam on October 4, 2019. .
