This statement was made by the doctor at the second joint conference on the digestive system (gastrointestinal cancer) at the professional level between the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital and the ASEAN Hospital this morning, October 4.
Dr. Su Siphana also called on people to seek early-stage cancer to reduce cancer mortality.
