NagaWorld Collaborates with "Thin Chalen" Cambodia to Assist Victims
(Phnom Penh): NagaWorld Charitable Heart, NagaWorld's social team, is working with "Thin Chalen" Cambodia to help young people and affected communities rebuild their lives through long-term support. One year of NagaWorld. This is according to a press release obtained by Fresh News.
NagaWorld's generous sponsorship will focus on health care, counseling, literacy programs and vocational training such as tailoring, eco-farming techniques and motorcycle repair skills.
