Director General of Taxation: Tax service agencies are important partners in providing tax services to contribute to the achievement of revenue collection strategies.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Kong Vibol, the Royal Government delegate in charge of the Director General of the General Department of Taxation, on October 3, stated that the tax service agency is an important partner in providing tax services to participate in achieving the mobilization strategy. Revenue.
Mr. Kong Vibol made this statement on the occasion of presiding over the opening ceremony of the dissemination workshop on "Rights and Obligations of the Tax Service Agency".
Mr. Oknha Sok Piseth, Co-Chair of the Working Group of the General Department of Taxation and the Private Sector, highlighted the importance of tax knowledge, which is a basic knowledge that all business people need to know in doing business, and highlighted the progress of the General Department of Taxation's reforms. Which makes it easier for taxpayers to fulfill their tax obligations.
Mr. Kong Vibol warmly welcomed the presence of Mr. Oknha, Chairman of the Working Group of the General Department of Taxation and the private sector, representatives of the National Accounting Council, representatives of the Garment Manufacturers Association of Cambodia, leaders and officials of the General Department of Taxation, and Ms. Neang Kanha. And enterprise representatives who took the time to attend this morning's workshop.
He also highlighted the close cooperation between the tax administration and the public sector and the continuation of further reforms to ensure the effective management of tax revenue collection, as well as to facilitate taxpayers to fulfill fiscal obligations. Taxes.
The Director General also informed the workshop that this workshop is designed for enterprises that are licensed as tax service agencies, which are increasing day by day. In fact, as of September 2019, the General Department of Taxation has trained 4,528 candidates for tax service agencies and 995 candidates have passed the tax service agency exam, of which 210 enterprises have been licensed as tax service agents.
"The tax service agency is an important partner of the General Department of Taxation in providing tax services to help achieve the objectives of the 2019-2023 revenue collection strategy," he said.
According to the planned agenda, the workshop organized a presentation on the main topics for the participants, including a presentation on:
1: Information Technology System of the General Department of Taxation to provide tax services to taxpayers 2: Rights and obligations of the Tax Service Agency 3: Criteria and benefits derived from the assessment of tax compliance and 4: Rules for the use of invoices For taxpayers who have registered taxes under the self-declaration regime.
Mr. Kong Vibol also thanked for the participation of the trainees who work in the field of tax service agencies who participated in providing questions, suggestions and constructive opinions so that the tax administration can be used as a basis for further study, consideration and improvement. Further, to achieve the two main objectives of the revenue collection strategy 2019-2023, as well as to strengthen the efficiency and transparency of tax revenue management.
He urged all business owners and representatives of licensed tax service agencies to share the knowledge gained this morning with non-participating colleagues with the goal of further enhancing and updating their knowledge and skills. Its profession to provide quality and professional services to taxpayers and perform their duties properly, timely and participate in preventing tax evasion.
