Mr. Kao Thach added that the scholarships you received today did not come by chance, but you got them by studying hard until you passed the exam and got a high score among the winning students. In addition, you spend your time helping the work of the society and the base where you are living.
He continued that through all these efforts, the students received an evaluation from the teachers from the local authority, and decided to receive a free scholarship from Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth.
In addition, when you go to college, Mr. Kao Thach continues to encourage and ask you to continue to work harder by strengthening the ability to step up to the job opportunities that are waiting for you.
