(Kampot): Professor Thea Kruy, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, said that in order for the health sector to develop more quality in providing health services to the people, we need to examine and improve the shortcomings leading to the development of the health sector, national and international standards.
At present, the training of human resources in the field of health and the basis of medical care, the provision of health services and matters related to public health are gaining momentum as the neighboring country is gaining momentum.
