Speaking on the occasion of handing out certificates and diplomas to more than 1,000 BELTEI International students this morning, October 2, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the four factors include: peace, infrastructure, people have the means to Travel and income factors of decent people.
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia said that on the occasion of Pchum Ben, Phnom Penh calmed down because people went to the provinces.
According to Samdech Techo Prime Minister, the first factor is peace. Samdech said that there is no place of insecurity for our country, so all the pagodas, all places of tourist attractions can be visited.
"This is the true value of peace," he said. In the past, our country was confronted with divisive warfare by armed forces or landmines, but now peace has taken over the whole country, allowing people to do almsgiving. "History must remember that our country was divided into segments, our last integration through the win-win policy of 1998, which we defined as the end of the war."
Samdech stated that this peace factor must be taken care of together, if not taken care of, do not talk about human rights, do not talk about democracy, do not talk about development. Bullets never know democracy, never know human rights, it is this peace factor that gives us the opportunity to hang out.
The second factor is the physical connectivity factor. Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued that although there is peace, it is difficult for our people to visit the district because there are no bridges and there are not enough roads. As of 2001 and 2002, our people did not travel to the district with their families.
For this infrastructure system, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that it is very important. Samdech Techo stated that if there is peace but the infrastructure is not connected, it will not allow people to travel easily.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that his wish was to connect the road along the Thai border by connecting Samlot, Battambang to Koh Kong, which is scheduled to open soon.
The third factor is that people have more means of transportation and more means of transportation. Samdech said that now more and more people are traveling by their own means and by private means.
The fourth factor is the income that people receive. Samdech emphasized that if people do not have income, they will not be able to travel. Our people, our workers have income, our farmers have income to do almsgiving, so in all the temples, almsgiving is done in all monasteries.
