(Phnom Penh): These days, on Facebook, some players have posted messages criticizing the management of Phnom Tamao Zoo under the leadership of the Forestry Administration of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, which allows some animals. Lose weight due to lack of food.
In response to this criticism, on October 2, 2019, Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, confirmed that the skinny animals are not lacking in food as criticized. He said that according to the report of the Forestry Administration, the skinny animals are sick and the Forestry Administration and three partner organizations have been cooperating on a regular basis.
He further explained that Phnom Tamao Zoo and Wildlife Rescue Center is a place for animal rehabilitation, so when there are wild animals or those who want to raise animals or have health problems fall ill, they are taken to Officials and partner organizations help maintain and treat, so some of the animals there are as thin as they lack food.
The Minister added, "Phnom Tamao Zoo Center is a wildlife rescue center, so any sick or sick animals are taken to that place, and the animals that are raised and they no longer want to be raised are taken to that place to be nurtured and treated." ... The location of Phnom Tamao Zoo is the most important wildlife rehabilitation center there, so some of the animals are sick and thin, which the three organizations cooperate with the Forestry Administration to do this work.
