Nescafe Celebrates International Coffee Day in Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): On October 1, 2019, thousands of Cambodians and Nescafe enthusiasts, along with people from more than 180 countries around the world, joined in the celebration and celebration of International Coffee Day. An event called "Nescafe Day" and this day was also held for the first time at the National Olympic Stadium in Phnom Penh with the distribution of Nescafe to many people.
Please note that the celebration of "Nescafe" Day also offers many Nescafe for free in some provinces such as Battambang, Siem Reap, Kampong Cham and Phnom Penh, so the public can enjoy the opportunity to enjoy delicious coffee. Delicious from Nescafe. Nescafe has also partnered with Total to offer a special offer to all customers: "Buy One Get One Free" for Nescafe canned coffee purchases in stores.
These activities are part of Nescafe's mission and values, which focus on connecting with the local community, sharing good quality products and promoting sustainable coffee. This month-long special offer aims to introduce coffee to new customers or customers who want to enjoy good quality coffee and share popular coffee brands with coffee lovers as well as connect with people. Cambodia is far from the city.
