(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Wednesday, October 2, 2019, will present certificates and diplomas to pedagogical students and A total of 1,183 undergraduate and graduate students, including 635 women. The ceremony of handing out certificates and diplomas will take place at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
Dr. Ly Chheng said that the university pays attention to promoting the education sector by focusing on morality and virtue and educating students to know their national identity, to love their country, their motherland, to respect state laws and not to discriminate on the basis of race. Comply with BELTEI Internal Rules and educate both knowledge and skills that are highly scientific in line with technological advances and the current 4.0 generation industrial revolution of the world.
