(Kampong Thom): People in Stong district, Kampong Thom province continue the tradition, customs and religious beliefs of the "Flower Festival" on Pchum Ben and after Pchum Ben, which lasts for 3 days, on the 29th. September 30 and October 1, in order to participate in the preservation of traditional beliefs.
Preah Chao Athikar Wat Kdei Deum (called Wat Kdei Deum) named Bhikkhu Nhean Panha Sok Sambo said that the organization of the flower boat ceremony on Pchum Ben day and after Pchum Ben day in Stong district in front of Wat Kdei Deum (called Wat Kdei Deum) ) Has been around since ancient times, which is about 400 years in succession. But it was interrupted because of the war, after which the peaceful period began to repeat every year.
He added that the flower boat race offers four major benefits, including:
* First: It is a place for the people of Stoung district to have fun for a long time * Second: It is a kind of sport that provides happiness, internal unity, and harmony to win over opponents * 3: Reduce long-distance travel that can lead to accidents eventually * 4: A tourist destination that brings income to local people, where the audience near to eat gasoline, buy dried fish, sausages and so on.
The players said that the happiness of all the people in Stong district after Pchum Ben Thom is the three-day Water Festival, which is a happy meeting place for people all over the district. In particular, it is involved in preserving and preserving traditions. In addition to fun, this boat brings unity, gathering, especially it is a belief as well as activities to bring the economy as well as bring happiness to the people throughout Stong district.
The boat people also called on young people to respect the traffic law by wearing a helmet when driving, whether near or far, driving with respect to the right of way, not using alcohol and speeding, driving with understanding and tolerance. Reciprocate and stay away from drugs.
