And 7: Discussion and approval of the draft law on the social security system. Samdech Preah Ream Norodom Bopha Devi: My father said that apart from China, no country loves Cambodia and supports us wholeheartedly
(Phnom Penh): On September 6, at 9:00 am, Samdech Preah Ream Norodom Bopha Tevy received an interview from the China-Cambodia Friendship Radio of the Central Radio and Television of China (CMG) and the Xinhua News Agency at the Royal Palace. To celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Interviews and interests of Samdech Preah Ream are as follows:
Q1: In what year did Prince Ream make his first visit to China?
It was a proud moment for me to visit His Majesty for the first time and we were honored to perform the Royal Ballet for the leadership at that time.
Question 2: Earlier, he said that in 1958, he accompanied His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk on a visit to China, I would like to ask how China-Cambodia relations are in That is why Samdech Ov led the Cambodian delegation to pay the first official visit to the state?
Samdech Preah Ream: After Cambodia gained independence in 1953, His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk led a Cambodian delegation to a meeting in Bandung, Indonesia in 1956. Therefore, Samdech Preah Norodom Sihanouk met with Mr. Chou Enlay, Director Chinese ministers for the first time and have been in touch ever since.
Question 3: I have seen many documents that show that during the royal visit to China, Prince Ream led Cambodian artists to perform the Royal Ballet for the top leaders of China, I would like to ask if there is a dance. What was performed at that time?
Question 4: At the end of 1970, Samdech Ov and some Khmer royal family lived in China. During his stay in China, were there any events that made Samdech Preah Ream remember unforgettable until now?
Question 5: At that time, Samdech Preah Ream was an artist in his 20s and it was a year when the situation of the country was difficult in both China and Cambodia. He was young and also an artist. Which makes him the happiest with Chinese artists?
Q6) Apart from performing the Royal Ballet in Beijing, has Prince Ream performed in other provinces?
Prince Ream: Yes, there are performances in Shanghai, Guangzhou, and many other provinces, I do not remember, but most clearly in Habin, a province bordering Russia.
Q7: When Samdech Preah Ream led a group of performing arts in Beijing and other provinces, what kind of atmosphere did the Chinese people visit when Preah Ream remembers?
Question 8: During the procession of Samdech Ov to Beijing at that time, did Samdech Preah Ream Mean see Samdech Preah Boromneath Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, ever help with art work?
Samdech Preah Ream: His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, when he was performing, he only performed with Chinese artists in ballet, hairdressing and romantic art. .
Q9: Samdech Ov has a close relationship with the Chinese leadership. Does Preah Ream remember any event when Samdech Ov was in China at that time?
Q10: Many photos show that during the Chinese National Day celebrations, His Majesty the King presided over the ceremony with President Mao Zedong and Zhou Enlai and many Chinese leaders. Thien An Palace is not for viewing army and art performances as well as fireworks. At that time, Samdech Preah Ream was also present there. Did Samdech Preah Ream remember that event?
Q11: How can Samdech Preah Ream evaluate Samdech Aub's enthusiasm for China?
Samdech Preah Ream: In my personal opinion, I think that Samdech Ov considered Zhou Enlai as his brother because HE Zhou Enlai was not only a national liberation fighter with President Mao Zedong and the top leaders of China. Other than that, but he is a very clear and regular person, when there are difficulties, we can rely on him, and he also helped back by showing support for China at the United Nations.
Q12: Samdech Ov has always said that he considers China as his second growth district, but there is some perception that it is a problem when considering other countries as his second homeland. Which?
Samdech Preah Ream: We have practical experience and see that our country is difficult or our country is in danger, China has never abandoned us, China has always supported us, so my father said. Apart from China, no country loves Cambodia sincerely and supports us wholeheartedly.
Q13: When Samdech Preah Ream first went to China, how were the people's livelihoods and infrastructure developed at that time? And how does it compare to the present?
Samdech Preah Ream: For me, more than 50 years ago, when I first traveled, they lived without high-rise houses like today, but they live in their own way. At that time, I always marched with Samdech through performance art, royal dance, and to this day, any country is developed. But until the leadership of His Excellency Xi Jinping today, no one is as good as him, even though China has a large population.
Q14: Under the leadership of HE Xi Jinping, who has laid out the strategic plan for the belt and the road in the past, how has it contributed to the economic development of the region and other countries?
Samdech Preah Ream: The goal of His Excellency Xi Jinping, you have set out a strategic plan for this belt and the road is very good for you Other than that, this is a very wonderful idea that he had the idea to do.
Q15: During Samdech Preah Ream's tenure as Deputy Minister of Culture and Fine Arts of Cambodia, what were the cultural exchanges between China and Cambodia?
Q16: When Samdech Preah Ream led a group of Cambodian artists to perform in China recently, how interested was Samdech Preah Ream?
Samdech Preah Ream: The spirit of the Chinese government and the Chinese people has not changed, they still support the Khmer art and the Khmer delegation as before, that is, bring the Khmer dance group to visit the Great Wall of China and organize a party Let and so on. I also thank the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia for facilitating this relationship.
Q17: October 1 is the Chinese National Day. And thinking of this year as the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, what did Samdech Preah Ream say to join in congratulating and wishing the Chinese people?
Prince Ream: I pray for China to prosper, I believe that the right leadership of President Xi Jinping, China will continue to make great progress. At the same time, I wish the Chinese leadership and people happiness forever.
